* ORDN2 -- Order entry screen 2: value, date, notes
MAP ORDN2 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER2   AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD ORDVALUE  AT 4,20  LEN 13 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD REQDATE   AT 5,20  LEN 10 UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD NOTES     AT 6,20  LEN 60 UNPROT DIM    COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD MSG2      AT 10,5  LEN 60 PROT   DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER2   AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT   DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
